      "Insight": "Apple’s installed base of active devices reached a new all-time high across all platforms by the end of fiscal 2026, reinforcing the company’s strong revenue and EPS growth during the year, as noted in the earnings release [line: L000014: \"Our installed base of active devices reached a new all-time high across all product categories.\"]"
